Ah yeah, I can move this to an exported function. Then users can update their main function to include some psuedo code like:

```
if os.Args[1] == "run" {
   err := JobExecutorLogic()
   // handle error
}

// else whatever their program normally does
```

And then users can pass `/proc/self/exe` as the JobExecutorPath. And this makes part 3 of this easier for the server binary to implement JobExecutor.

